\"${srcdir}/llama.cpp\" -B \"${srcdir}/build\" -G Ninja \\\n```\n*   **`-S \"${srcdir}/llama.cpp\"`:** Specifies the **source directory**. This is where the downloaded git repository lives.\n*   **`-B \"${srcdir}/build\"`:** Specifies the **build directory**. CMake will generate all intermediate files (Makefiles, Ninja files, object files) here. This keeps the source tree clean.\n*   **`-G Ninja`:** Tells CMake to generate build files for **"}